ve\": \"To advance the field of robotics through innovative design and development.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"German\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://bobwilliams.com/robots\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-04-15\"\n}"}
