motive Innovations Inc.\",\n            \"role\": \"Design Engineer\",\n            \"duration\": \"2021 - Present\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Mechanical Design\",\n        \"Finite Element Analysis\",\n        \"CAD Modeling\",\n        \"Problem Solving\",\n        \"Teamwork\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To contribute my mechanical engineering skills and passion for sustainable design to a challenging and innovative role within the automotive industry.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.example.com/alicejohnsonportfolio\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
