n        \"Leadership\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To contribute expertise in thermal engineering to innovative automotive projects.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicejohnson.com/portfolio\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
