al Engineer\",\n            \"duration\": \"2018 - Present\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Problem-solving\",\n        \"Teamwork\",\n        \"Communication\",\n        \"Project Management\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging role in automotive engineering where I can leverage my expertise in thermal management and design to contribute to innovative solutions.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"German\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.alicejohnsonportfolio.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
