Mechanical Engineer / Project Lead\",\n            \"duration\": \"3 years\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"company\": \"Engineering Solutions Ltd.\",\n            \"title\": \"Mechanical Engineer\",\n            \"duration\": \"2 years\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Mechanical Design\",\n        \"Project Management\",\n        \"CAD\",\n        \"FEA\",\n        \"Team Leadership\",\n        \"Problem Solving\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To contribute my expertise in mechanical engineering and project management to a challenging and innovative role within the automotive industry.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://johnsmithportfolio.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
