ective\": \"To contribute my expertise in thermal systems and project management to a challenging and innovative engineering role.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.example.com/alicejohnsonportfolio\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
