jective\": \"Seeking a challenging Mechanical Engineering position where I can leverage my skills in thermal analysis and project management to contribute to innovative projects.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.example.com/alicejohnsonportfolio\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-01-15\"\n}"}
