e in sustainable energy where I can apply my mechanical engineering expertise.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"http://alicejohnson.portfolio.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
