al Engineer\",\n            \"duration\": \"5 years\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Design\",\n        \"Analysis\",\n        \"Project Management\",\n        \"Problem Solving\",\n        \"Communication\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To contribute my skills and experience to a challenging and innovative role in the automotive industry, with opportunities for professional growth.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.example.com/alicejohnsonportfolio\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-01\"\n}"}
