neer\",\n            \"duration\": \"2020-2023\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"company\": \"Automotive Dynamics Corp.\",\n            \"role\": \"Lead Design Engineer\",\n            \"duration\": \"2023-Present\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Design\",\n        \"Analysis\",\n        \"Testing\",\n        \"Problem Solving\",\n        \"Teamwork\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To contribute my skills and experience in mechanical engineering to a challenging and innovative role within a forward-thinking organization focused on sustainable transportation.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.example.com/alicejohnsonportfolio\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
