ngineer\",\n            \"duration\": \"5 years\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Engine Design\",\n        \"Project Management\",\n        \"FEA Analysis\",\n        \"CAD Modeling\",\n        \"Problem Solving\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging mechanical engineering role where I can leverage my project management and design skills to contribute to innovative automotive solutions.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.exampleportfolio.com/alicejohnson\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
