"Automotive Innovations Inc.\",\n            \"role\": \"Mechanical Engineer\",\n            \"duration\": \"3.5 years\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Mechanical Design\",\n        \"Finite Element Analysis\",\n        \"CAD Modeling\",\n        \"Problem Solving\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging mechanical engineering role focused on innovation and automotive applications.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.johndoeportfolio.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
