n        \"CAD\",\n        \"FEA\",\n        \"CFD\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging mechanical engineering position where I can utilize my skills and experience to contribute to the development of innovative automotive solutions.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-07-26\"\n}"}
