ngineer\",\n            \"duration\": \"2018 - Present\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Project Management\",\n        \"Design\",\n        \"Analysis\",\n        \"Problem Solving\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To contribute my expertise in mechanical engineering to a challenging and innovative role.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://johnsmithportfolio.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
