blem Solving\",\n        \"Teamwork\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging mechanical engineering role focused on sustainable automotive technologies.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.example.com/alice-smith-portfolio\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-01\"\n}"}
