oject Management\",\n        \"Teamwork\",\n        \"Communication\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To contribute my expertise in mechanical engineering to a challenging and innovative role in the automotive industry.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.example.com/alicejohnsonportfolio\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
