ective\": \"To contribute my mechanical engineering expertise to a challenging and innovative role in the automotive industry.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://johndoe.com/portfolio\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-01-15\"\n}"}
