lem Solving\",\n        \"Analytical Skills\",\n        \"Communication\",\n        \"Project Management\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking an electrical engineering position in the power systems industry.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"French\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alicejohnsonportfolio.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-02-20\"\n}"}
