ical Engineer\",\n            \"duration\": \"2018 - Present\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Design\",\n        \"Analysis\",\n        \"Testing\",\n        \"Problem-Solving\",\n        \"Teamwork\",\n        \"Communication\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging mechanical engineering position where I can apply my skills and experience to develop innovative solutions.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\",\n        \"Spanish\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://alexjohnsonportfolio.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
