esign\",\n        \"Testing\",\n        \"Problem Solving\",\n        \"Team Leadership\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"To contribute my expertise in mechanical engineering and project management to a challenging and innovative automotive environment.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://www.exampleportfolio.com/alicejohnson\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
