ective\": \"Seeking a challenging mechanical engineering role where I can leverage my experience in automotive systems and robotics to contribute to innovative projects.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [\n        \"https://johnsmithportfolio.com\"\n    ],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
